+- `[REQ-VIS-003]` given a blank description, when the correction is submitted, then the correction is refused, the description is named, and the form is shown again.
+- `[REQ-VIS-003]` given a date of today or earlier, when the correction is submitted, then the correction is refused, the date is named, and the form is shown again.
 
